\pard\qc\f0\fs44\sa120 \b THOG2 Layer Dropout Requirements Specification\b0 \par
\pard\qc\f0\fs30\sa120 \b v0.1\b0 \par
\pard\qc\f0\fs24\sa360 \i Stratified stochastic execution of nominal transformer layers\i0 \par
\pard\ql\f0\fs22\sa220 This specification defines a training-time layer-dropout facility for THOG2. The canonical model depth remains unchanged; each training update may execute only a sampled subset of the nominal layer positions.\par
\pard\ql\f0\fs22\sa180 Status: requirements specification for initial implementation, including wrapper controls and descriptor v2.1 identity.\par
\pard\ql\f0\fs22\sa180 Repository path: docs/THOG2_Layer_Dropout_Requirements_Specification_v0.1.rtf\par
\pard\ql\f0\fs22\sa180 Date: 26 July 2026\par
